OL,3,GNEWSA'At risk' windmill cap and sails
OL,4,Ato be removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sails and cap will temporarily be
OL,7,Ftaken off Lincoln's last remaining
OL,8,Fwindmill in an effort to save it.
OL,10,FEllis Mill, which was built in 1798, is
OL,11,Fthe last of nine that once stood on
OL,12,FLincoln's Yarborough hill. It is now on
OL,13,FHistoric England's at-risk register.
OL,15,FLincolnshire County Council, which owns
OL,16,Fthe Grade II listed building, is
OL,17,Fplanning to remove the mill's cap and
OL,18,Fsails and install a temporary
OL,19,Fweatherproof structure to maintain its
OL,20,Fstructural integrity.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
