OL,3,GNEWSA'At risk' windmill cap and sails
OL,4,Ato be removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign group, which is keen to take
OL,7,Fover the running of the building, said
OL,8,Fit would mean the loss of an "iconic
OL,9,Fimage" in the city until it was
OL,10,Frepaired.
